{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026vGV0cEaGwP1794740361.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>江蘇興化市有工廠發生爆炸，至少1人受傷送院。</p><p></p><p>爆炸在周六晚約11時半發生，現場火光熊熊，附近居民指家中有門窗被震爛，幾公里外都能見到火光。當局稱，涉事的是一間油脂工廠，有油罐車爆炸，至少一名工人受輕傷，正調查事故起因。</p><p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T12:00:23.228685+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":109,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T10:54:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T13:11:38.182980+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T11:54:05.579889+00:00","content_hash":"f0e1291fd9953f9ba7d2d9f50cfc4acf325ef79a8fa89305e02504b9209a051a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-15T12:00:23.228685+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}